{
  "alert_id" : "ALR-00002",
  "priority" : 1,
  "justification" : "TX-00454 brought 48000.00 CAD in by wire from EXT-2224 on 2026-09-16, and TX-00496 sent 45500.00 CAD out by wire to EXT-2137 on the same day, about five hours later. About 94.8% of the funds left the account the same day, and C1059 has no other activity. This matches the R4 pass-through pattern and warrants high priority."
}

{
  "case_id" : "CAS-00002",
  "justification" : "C1059 received 48000.00 CAD by wire from EXT-2224 (TX-00454, 2026-09-16) and sent 45500.00 CAD by wire to EXT-2137 (TX-00496, 2026-09-16), the same day. The account retains 2500.00 CAD, about 5% of the inflow. Both legs are domestic (CA). The account has no other transactions and no legitimate explanation appears in the data, such as payroll or business income. Same-day in-and-out movement matches FINTRAC indicators for rapid movement through an account. Reasonable grounds to suspect a pass-through laundering role exist. A human analyst should review and consider an STR."
}
